# .gitignore for the public Void Linux Installer export.
# Dated snapshot copies of the installer. Git history replaces the manual
# dated-snapshot ritual, so these are not tracked.
snapshots/
# Generated from INSTALL_PROMPTS.md; regenerable — keep the .md source only.
INSTALL_PROMPTS.pdf
# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
# Local scratch / debug artifacts — never shipped.
Debug/*
# ...except the QEMU validation harness this release ships (tracked files
# only: the ISO, the extracted live kernel/initrd and per-case artifacts
# are not tracked and stay out). git cannot re-include under an excluded
# directory, hence Debug/* + negation rather than a bare Debug/.
!Debug/qemu-matrix/
*.bak
*.log
